        "2": {
            "ID": "1936403",
            "URL": "https://thetvdb.com/series/384642-/seasons/official/2",
            "Titles": {
                "eng": null,
                "jpn": null,
                "zho": "第二季"
            },
            "Summaries": {
                "eng": "After crossing the Thousand Forbidden Lands, Wang Sheng, a soldier , arrives in the Worry-free City where the iron rule is \"no fight in the inner city and no killing in the outer city\". By developing a culinary business, he succeeded in making a comeback. But his success was not long in coming, as his identity was eventually revealed. The secret of his \"soul advancement\" is coveted by the Five Families, and a game between Wang Sheng and the Five Families, using the city as a chessboard, begins here",
                "jpn": null,
                "zho": "兵王王胜穿越千绝地后，来到以“内城不能动手，外城不能杀人”为铁则的无忧城中。通过发展卤肉生意，成功走上逆袭。好景不长，他隐姓埋名，最终还是暴露了身份。而他“元魂晋级”的秘密被五大家觊觎，一场王胜与五大家以无忧城为棋盘的对弈便在此展开……"
            },
